  "title": "Chocolate Beet Muffins",
  "description": "Would you believe that chocolate and beets can work together to deliver a tasty muffin? Try this relatively simple recipe and you shall!",
  "authors": [
    "carmel"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:02:22-04:00",
